BUG-001: Previously Mastered Topic Marked Unmastered After Single Low Homework Score
Severity: High | Priority: High
Module: Mastery & Progress Tracking
Environment: Web App (Chrome / Windows 11)

Description:
When a student retakes a quiz or homework on an already mastered topic and scores lower than the mastery threshold, the system overwrites the existing mastery status instead of preserving best score and historical mastery.

Steps to Reproduce:
1. Log in with a student account that has Mastered status (Best Score: 90%) on Linear Equations.
2. Start a follow-up practice/homework attempt for Linear Equations.
3. Submit the attempt with a score of 40%.
4. Navigate to the Topic Progress dashboard.

Expected Result:
- Historical mastery and Best Score (90%) remain preserved.
- Latest Score (40%) is recorded separately without deleting previous attempt records.

Actual Result:
- Topic status changes from Mastered to Weak, and the previous 90% mastery record is overwritten.

